    "Moonlight contributes 40%, clouds 25%, estimated light pollution 20%, and the length of true darkness 15%. Without a cloud forecast, the other weights are scaled to 100. No true darkness caps a night below 40, and the cap lifts gradually over the first three hours of true darkness.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moonlight contributes 40%, clouds 25%, estimated light pollution 20%, and the length of true darkness 15%. Without a cloud forecast, the other weights are scaled to 100. No true darkness caps a night below 40, and the cap lifts gradually over the first three hours of true darkness."
          }
        }
      }
    },
